    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this fantastic two-bedroom, first floor apartment in this highly sought-after development in Artane, Dublin 5. Located just off the Malahide road in the ever popular and sought-after development of the Timber Mill in Artane, this property offers an excellent opportunity for prospective buyers. The Timber Mill is a highly sought-after development within arm's reach to a wealth of local amenities. Close to primary and secondary schools, as well as DCU. Artane Castle shopping centre is conveniently adjacent to the development. There are numerous bus services within 10 minutes' walk to the City Centre and surrounding areas. Killester Dart station and Beaumont Hospital are only a short walk from the development. The property is also close to Dublin Airport, the M50 and M1. This superb development has landscaped grounds and a designated parking space.\nBright and spacious living accommodation of c. 54 sqm comprises of an entrance hallway, open plan living/kitchen/dining area, 2 double bedrooms with built in wardrobes and a fully tiled bathroom. There is a private balcony off the living room. No.24 boasts gas fired central heating, balcony off living room , quality flooring, double glazed windows and a designated parking space.\nAn opportunity not to be missed: call Ray Cooke Auctioneers on 086 0469458 or 01 6995050 today for further information or to arrange viewing!!\n\nAdditional Features;\n- c. 54 sqm\n- 2 bed 1 bath\n- BER C2\n- 1st floor position\n- Private balcony\n- Highly sought-after development\n- Excellent primary and secondary schools in the area\n- Fantastic location\n- Easy access to M50 & M1 motorway\n- Bus routes to City Centre within 10 minutes' walk\n- Killester Dart station closeby\n- Beaumont hospital closeby\n- Adjacent to Artane Shopping Centre\n- Close to a wealth of local amenities\n- Management fees c. 2,100 per annum\n- Ideal for First Time Buyers and Investors\n- Early viewing highly advised!!\n\nDirections:\nTravelling on the Malahide Road, turn right onto Kilmore Rd, turn right at Maryfield Crescent, turn left into The Timber Mill. 24 will be located on your right-hand side."
      },
      {
